      "date": "2026-07-27 19:57:28.000000000",
      "message": "Patch Set 1:\n\n(3 comments)\n\nAI code review results below, please doublecheck\n\nExperimental feature testing in progress, please pay attention to the comments\n\nThe dirdata copy itself checks out: ext4_get_dirent_data_len() returns the NUL pad plus each blob, so copying that many bytes from dirent->name + dirent->name_len onto new_fn->name + ent_name->len lands the LUFID exactly where do_osd_ldiskfs_filldir() reads it at name + namelen + 1. Only minor comments inline.",
