      "date": "2026-07-30 20:01:54.000000000",
      "message": "Patch Set 3:\n\n(2 comments)\n\nAI code review results below, please doublecheck\n\nMostly good, minor comments inline. The fix itself checks out: extra_data covers the NUL pad plus the dirdata blob returned by ext4_get_dirent_data_len(), the copy stays inside the kzalloc_flex()/struct_size() allocation, and the destination offset matches where osd_ldiskfs_filldir() reads the packed FID (name + namelen + 1). Both 7.0 series files were switched, and all four dirdata-core variants (6.12, rhel10.1, 6.18, 7.0) now carry the hunk.",
